 "desc": "Goal: Analyze a fully hardened binary with all major mitigations enabled. A checksec-style summary shows: ASLR+PIE (randomized addresses), NX (non-executable stack), Canary (stack cookie), Full RELRO (read-only GOT), and CET (hardware CFI). Understand what each mitigation blocks and what attack classes remain even with all of them active.",
